<description>toody5.def

 y  trend rain year t
  
	Obs:   48 annual observations for 1950-1997

    y 		wheat yield in tonnes per hectare for the Toodyay Shire of Western Australia
    trend  	trend term to allow for technological change
		1950=0, 1951=0.1, 1952=0.2, 1953=0.3, ..., 1960=1, ..., 1997=4.7
    rain 	total rainfall over the growing season (May to october) measured in decimeters.
    t		a second trend term 1950=1, 1951=2,..., 1997=48
           


 Data Source:  
       These data were collected by Lisa Newton for her PhD at the University of New England.



